<p>Zindan Mein Ro Ro Ke Ye Kehti Thi Sakina</p>

<p>Bin Aap Ke Jina Mera Dushwar Hai Baba,</p>

<p> 1. Mera Ali Asghar Hai Na Abbas Chacha Hain</p>

<p>Sab Margaye Mera Na Koi Aj Bacha Hain</p>

<p>Main Kaise Jiyungi Ye Batado Shahe Wala,</p>

<p> 2. Jab Roti Hai Baba Tere Gham Mein Teri Duqtar</p>

<p>Tab Aake Sitam Karte Hain Aada O Sitamgar</p>

<p>Or Shimre Layen Aake Lagata Hai Tamacha,</p>

<p> 3. Hasrat Thi Kabhi Jayungi Mein Apne Watan Ko</p>

<p>Dikhlayungi Sughra Ko Mein In Daghe Rasan Ko</p>

<p>Lekin Na Tha Taqdeer Mein Ghar Lout Ke Jaana,</p>

<p> 4. Rone Se Mere Hota Qalal Hai Inhe Kyonkar</p>

<p>Rakhte Hai Jo Tanha Mujhe Apnao Se Churakar</p>

<p>Baba Kya Ye Zindan Mein Hai Apka Seena,..</p>

<p>Az: Faiyaz Razvi(Anjuman E Asghari)</p>